   5:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****   * @brief   OPAMP HAL module driver.
   6:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****   *          This file provides firmware functions to manage the following
   7:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****   *          functionalities of the operational amplifiers peripheral:
   8:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****   *           + Initialization/de-initialization functions
   9:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****   *           + I/O operation functions
