  25:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c **** ================================================================================
  26:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****           ##### OPAMP Peripheral Features #####
  27:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c **** ================================================================================
  28:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c **** 
  29:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****   [..] The device integrates up to 6 operational amplifiers OPAMP1, OPAMP2,
ARM GAS  /tmp/ccgXo9EF.s 			page 2


  30:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****        OPAMP3, OPAMP4, OPAMP5 and OPAMP6:
  31:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c **** 
  32:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****        (#) The OPAMP(s) provides several exclusive running modes.
  33:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****        (++) Standalone mode
  34:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****        (++) Programmable Gain Amplifier (PGA) mode (Resistor feedback output)
  35:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****        (++) Follower mode
  36:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c **** 
  37:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****        (#) The OPAMP(s) provide(s) calibration capabilities.
  38:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****        (++) Calibration aims at correcting some offset for running mode.
  39:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****        (++) The OPAMP uses either factory calibration settings OR user defined
  40:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****            calibration (trimming) settings (i.e. trimming mode).
  41:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****        (++) The user defined settings can be figured out using self calibration
  42:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****            handled by HAL_OPAMP_SelfCalibrate, HAL_OPAMPEx_SelfCalibrateAll
  43:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****        (++) HAL_OPAMP_SelfCalibrate:
  44:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****        (++) Runs automatically the calibration in 2 steps.
  45:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****             (90% of VDDA for NMOS transistors, 10% of VDDA for PMOS transistors).
  46:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****             (As OPAMP is Rail-to-rail input/output, these 2 steps calibration is
  47:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****             appropriate and enough in most cases).
  48:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****        (++) Enables the user trimming mode
  49:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****        (++) Updates the init structure with trimming values with fresh calibration
  50:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****             results.
  51:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****             The user may store the calibration results for larger
  52:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****             (ex monitoring the trimming as a function of temperature
  53:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****             for instance)
  54:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****        (++) for STM32G4 devices having 6 OPAMPs
  55:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****             HAL_OPAMPEx_SelfCalibrateAll
  56:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****             runs calibration of 6 OPAMPs in parallel.
  57:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c **** 
  58:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****        (#) For any running mode, an additional Timer-controlled Mux (multiplexer)
  59:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****            mode can be set on top.
  60:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****        (++) Timer-controlled Mux mode allows Automatic switching of inputs
  61:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****            configuration (inverting and non inverting).
  62:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****        (++) Hence on top of defaults (primary) inverting and non-inverting inputs,
  63:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****            the user shall select secondary inverting and non inverting inputs.
  64:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****        (++) TIM1 OC6, TIM8 OC6 and TIM20 OC6 provides the alternate switching
  65:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****            tempo between defaults (primary) and secondary inputs.
  66:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****        (++) These 3 timers (TIM1, TIM8 and TIM20) can be combined to design a more
  67:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****            complex switching scheme. So that any of the selected channel can initiate
  68:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****            the configuration switch.
  69:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c **** 
  70:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****        (#) Running mode: Standalone mode
  71:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****        (++) Gain is set externally (gain depends on external loads).
  72:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****        (++) Follower mode also possible externally by connecting the inverting input to
  73:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****            the output.
  74:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c **** 
  75:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****        (#) Running mode: Follower mode
  76:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****        (++) Inverting Input is not connected.
  77:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c **** 
  78:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****        (#) Running mode: Programmable Gain Amplifier (PGA) mode
  79:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****            (Resistor feedback output)
  80:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****        (++) The OPAMP(s) output(s) can be internally connected to resistor feedback
  81:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****            output.
  82:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****        (++) The OPAMP inverting input can be "not" connected, signal to amplify is
  83:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****            connected to non inverting input and gain is positive (2,4,8,16,32 or 64)
  84:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****        (++) The OPAMP inverting input can be connected to VINM0:
  85:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****            If signal is applied to non inverting input, gain is positive (2,4,8,16,32 or 64).
  86:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****            If signal is applied to inverting input, gain is negative (-1,-3,-7,-15-,31 or -63).
ARM GAS  /tmp/ccgXo9EF.s 			page 3


  87:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****            In both cases, the other input can be used as bias.
  88:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c **** 
  89:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c **** 
  90:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****             ##### How to use this driver #####
  91:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c **** ================================================================================
  92:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****   [..]
  93:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c **** 
  94:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****     *** High speed / normal power mode ***
  95:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****     ============================================
  96:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****     [..]  To run in high speed mode:
  97:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c **** 
  98:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****       (#) Configure the OPAMP using HAL_OPAMP_Init() function:
  99:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****       (++) Select OPAMP_POWERMODE_HIGHSPEED
 100:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****       (++) Otherwise select OPAMP_POWERMODE_NORMALSPEED
 101:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c **** 
 102:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****     *** Calibration ***
 103:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****     ============================================
 104:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****     [..]  To run the OPAMP calibration self calibration:
 105:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c **** 
 106:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****       (#) Start calibration using HAL_OPAMP_SelfCalibrate.
 107:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****            Store the calibration results.
 108:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c **** 
 109:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****     *** Running mode ***
 110:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****     ============================================
 111:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****     [..]  To use the OPAMP, perform the following steps:
 112:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c **** 
 113:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****       (#) Fill in the HAL_OPAMP_MspInit() to
 114:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****       (++) Configure the OPAMP input AND output in analog mode using
 115:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****           HAL_GPIO_Init() to map the OPAMP output to the GPIO pin.
 116:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c **** 
 117:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****       (#) Registrate Callbacks
 118:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****       (++) The compilation define  USE_HAL_OPAMP_REGISTER_CALLBACKS when set to 1
 119:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****            allows the user to configure dynamically the driver callbacks.
 120:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c **** 
 121:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****       (++) Use Functions HAL_OPAMP_RegisterCallback() to register a user callback,
 122:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****            it allows to register following callbacks:
 123:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****       (+++) MspInitCallback         : OPAMP MspInit.
 124:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****       (+++) MspDeInitCallback       : OPAMP MspDeInit.
 125:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****            This function takes as parameters the HAL peripheral handle, the Callback ID
 126:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****            and a pointer to the user callback function.
 127:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c **** 
 128:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****       (++) Use function HAL_OPAMP_UnRegisterCallback() to reset a callback to the default
 129:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****            weak (surcharged) function. It allows to reset following callbacks:
 130:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****       (+++) MspInitCallback         : OPAMP MspInit.
 131:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****       (+++) MspDeInitCallback       : OPAMP MspDeInit.
 132:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****       (+++) All Callbacks
 133:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c **** 
 134:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****       (#) Configure the OPAMP using HAL_OPAMP_Init() function:
 135:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****       (++) Select the mode
 136:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****       (++) Select the inverting input
 137:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****       (++) Select the non-inverting input
 138:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****       (++) Select if the internal output should be enabled/disabled (if enabled, regular I/O output
 139:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****       (++) Select if the Timer controlled Mux is disabled or enabled and controlled by specified ti
 140:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****       (++) If the Timer controlled Mux mode is enabled, select the secondary inverting input
 141:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****       (++) If the Timer controlled Mux mode is enabled, Select the secondary non-inverting input
 142:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****       (++) If PGA mode is enabled, Select if inverting input is connected.
 143:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****       (++) If PGA mode is enabled, Select PGA gain to be used.
ARM GAS  /tmp/ccgXo9EF.s 			page 4


 144:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****       (++) Select either factory or user defined trimming mode.
 145:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****       (++) If the user defined trimming mode is enabled, select PMOS & NMOS trimming values
 146:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****           (typ. settings returned by HAL_OPAMP_SelfCalibrate function).
 147:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c **** 
 148:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****       (#) Enable the OPAMP using HAL_OPAMP_Start() function.
 149:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c **** 
 150:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****       (#) Disable the OPAMP using HAL_OPAMP_Stop() function.
 151:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c **** 
 152:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****       (#) Lock the OPAMP in running mode using HAL_OPAMP_Lock() & HAL_OPAMP_TimerMuxLock functions.
 153:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****           From then the configuration can only be modified
 154:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****       (++) After HW reset
 155:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****       (++) OR thanks to HAL_OPAMP_MspDeInit called (user defined) from HAL_OPAMP_DeInit.
 156:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c **** 
 157:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****     *** Running mode: change of configuration while OPAMP ON  ***
 158:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****     ============================================
 159:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****     [..]    To Re-configure OPAMP when OPAMP is ON (change on the fly)
 160:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****       (#) If needed, fill in the HAL_OPAMP_MspInit()
 161:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****       (++) This is the case for instance if you wish to use new OPAMP I/O
 162:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c **** 
 163:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****       (#) Configure the OPAMP using HAL_OPAMP_Init() function:
 164:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****       (++) As in configure case, selects first the parameters you wish to modify.
 165:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****       (++) If OPAMP control register is locked, it is not possible to modify any values
 166:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****           on the fly (even the timer controlled mux parameters).
 167:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****       (++) If OPAMP timer controlled mux mode register is locked, it is possible to modify any valu
 168:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****           of the control register but none on the timer controlled mux mode one.
 169:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c **** 
 170:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****       (#) Change from high speed mode to normal power mode (& vice versa) requires
 171:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****           first HAL_OPAMP_DeInit() (force OPAMP OFF) and then HAL_OPAMP_Init().
 172:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****           In other words, of OPAMP is ON, HAL_OPAMP_Init can NOT change power mode
 173:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****           alone.
 174:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c **** 
 175:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****   @endverbatim
 176:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****   ******************************************************************************
 177:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****   */
