 287:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****   * @brief  Initializes the OPAMP according to the specified
 288:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_opamp.c ****   *         parameters in the OPAMP_InitTypeDef and initialize the associated handle.
